WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.876 --> 00:00:03.378
Welcome to the
"For All Mankind Podcast."

00:00:03.462 --> 00:00:05.422
I am your host, Krys Marshall

00:00:05.506 --> 00:00:07.466
We're gonna talk about the show,

00:00:07.549 --> 00:00:09.551
we're gonna meet some
real-life astronauts,

00:00:09.635 --> 00:00:12.387
and chat with some of my
favorite folks from the show.

00:00:12.471 --> 00:00:14.097
Super excited.
Here we go.

00:00:14.181 --> 00:00:15.307
Let's go make history.

00:00:16.600 --> 00:00:18.769
When you're in Earth orbit,
we're above the atmosphere,

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:20.938
but we're still below
the Earth's magnetic field.

00:00:22.481 --> 00:00:24.566
We're really getting into
the meat of the show.

00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:26.610
Those more sci-fi inklings,

00:00:26.693 --> 00:00:29.530
and the bigger picture
is starting to get revealed.

00:00:30.656 --> 00:00:32.783
NASA would have pushed
the technology forward.

00:00:32.866 --> 00:00:35.160
An electric car would have been
possible in the 80's.

00:00:36.620 --> 00:00:40.832
I wanted to kind of rekindle that sense
of wonder and awe about flying into space.

00:00:42.417 --> 00:00:43.710
We came in the name of science,

00:00:43.794 --> 00:00:46.296
we came in the name of discovery,
and of a new frontier.

00:00:46.380 --> 00:00:49.466
I mean, it's what Ed says,
we came for all mankind.

00:00:49.550 --> 00:00:52.010
Once we do this thing,
there's no going back.

00:00:56.306 --> 00:00:57.182
KRYS: Say good-bye, guys.

00:00:57.266 --> 00:00:59.017
- SONYA: Bye, thank you!
- MATT: Bye, thanks, Krys.

00:00:59.101 --> 00:01:00.143
KRYS: Great. Thank you, guys!

